{"_id":"6a3f87c150eddded814ad17e","id":"rumourscape/tenders","author":"rumourscape","sha":"401d093cc74d7a05e7d48326c1bc11edb289d7bb","lastModified":"2026-06-27T09:05:52.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1M<n<10M","format:arrow","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:mlcroissant","region:us"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIndian Government Tenders and Awards Dataset\n\t\n\nA dataset of tenders and awards scraped from the Central Public Procurement Portal (CPPP) of India. Data sourced from https://tender.sarthaksidhant.com/ and then joined and converted to parquet via https://gist.github.com/rhnvrm/8060dedb15ae592dae492ec62f725c0c.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUsing the dataset\n\t\n\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\ndata = load_dataset(\"rumourscape/tenders\")\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAcknowledgements\n\t\n\n\nSarthak Siddhant for scraping… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rumourscape/tenders.","downloads":38,"likes":1,"cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"data-00000-of-00002.arrow"},{"rfilename":"data-00001-of-00002.arrow"},{"rfilename":"dataset_info.json"},{"rfilename":"state.json"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-27T08:20:17.000Z","usedStorage":5174207202}